{"3620240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yots", "steam_appid": 3620240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glory to Yots!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for a tedious office job with a penny-pinching boss when you can become a cultist of a demonic entity?<br><br>Yots is waging war against the otherworldly City, and he seeks new followers. Armed ones. Obedient ones. The ones who don’t ask unnecessary questions and follow instructions to the letter. <br><br>The Cult will show you the way.<br>The Cult will take care of you.<br>The Cult will DEFINITELY not let your consciousness fall apart in the middle of the hostile City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/c9a5bde1f07d0596a465fc40ee0be1bf.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/c9a5bde1f07d0596a465fc40ee0be1bf.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/c9a5bde1f07d0596a465fc40ee0be1bf.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A war with no beginning or end</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The City is an ancient entity from beyond our reality. It absorbs human consciousness, devouring it and changing along with it.<br><br>The City won’t stand idly by while the Cult tramples through its streets. The fog will obscure the roads, the walls will change shape, and creatures will crawl from the City’s flesh, born for one purpose only — to stop you.<br><br>Destroy it, or it will devour you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f5b15162349917ac4a80dfe4821c3a19.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f5b15162349917ac4a80dfe4821c3a19.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f5b15162349917ac4a80dfe4821c3a19.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your goal — chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not here to tidy up the streets. Burn, smash, tear it apart — deal as much damage to the City as you can before making it back out.<br><br>The City will try to stop you, resisting more fiercely with every blow. But there’s nothing good old-fashioned violence can’t solve, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/8dbb1077ed7514fa14d90b0426317dc3.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/8dbb1077ed7514fa14d90b0426317dc3.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/8dbb1077ed7514fa14d90b0426317dc3.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And remember — everything’s more fun with friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a party of up to four cultists, head out on a raid, and show everyone — including Yots — what you’re capable of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/bdfae9841dca3763111a2368a62b2b9c.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/bdfae9841dca3763111a2368a62b2b9c.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/bdfae9841dca3763111a2368a62b2b9c.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PSX-style graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1930s-inspired aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated City</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The love and respect of our lord Yots</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glory to Yots!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for a tedious office job with a penny-pinching boss when you can become a cultist of a demonic entity?<br><br>Yots is waging war against the otherworldly City, and he seeks new followers. Armed ones. Obedient ones. The ones who don’t ask unnecessary questions and follow instructions to the letter. <br><br>The Cult will show you the way.<br>The Cult will take care of you.<br>The Cult will DEFINITELY not let your consciousness fall apart in the middle of the hostile City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/c9a5bde1f07d0596a465fc40ee0be1bf.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/c9a5bde1f07d0596a465fc40ee0be1bf.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/c9a5bde1f07d0596a465fc40ee0be1bf.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A war with no beginning or end</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The City is an ancient entity from beyond our reality. It absorbs human consciousness, devouring it and changing along with it.<br><br>The City won’t stand idly by while the Cult tramples through its streets. The fog will obscure the roads, the walls will change shape, and creatures will crawl from the City’s flesh, born for one purpose only — to stop you.<br><br>Destroy it, or it will devour you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f5b15162349917ac4a80dfe4821c3a19.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f5b15162349917ac4a80dfe4821c3a19.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/f5b15162349917ac4a80dfe4821c3a19.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your goal — chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not here to tidy up the streets. Burn, smash, tear it apart — deal as much damage to the City as you can before making it back out.<br><br>The City will try to stop you, resisting more fiercely with every blow. But there’s nothing good old-fashioned violence can’t solve, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/8dbb1077ed7514fa14d90b0426317dc3.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/8dbb1077ed7514fa14d90b0426317dc3.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/8dbb1077ed7514fa14d90b0426317dc3.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And remember — everything’s more fun with friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a party of up to four cultists, head out on a raid, and show everyone — including Yots — what you’re capable of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/bdfae9841dca3763111a2368a62b2b9c.poster.avif?t=1786964326\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/bdfae9841dca3763111a2368a62b2b9c.webm?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620240/extras/bdfae9841dca3763111a2368a62b2b9c.mp4?t=1786964326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PSX-style graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1930s-inspired aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated City</p></li